    <h2>Pumpkin Pie Blizzard — Fall 2026 Seasonal</h2>
    <p>The Pumpkin Pie Blizzard is DQ's signature fall release and one of the most searched seasonal treats in fast food each autumn. It captures the full pumpkin pie experience — spiced pumpkin filling, buttery graham cracker crust, and a hint of cinnamon — blended into cold, creamy soft serve. It is warm in flavor, cool in texture, and available only for a limited time each fall. For all current Blizzard options, see <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>.</p>
    <h2>What's in the Pumpkin Pie Blizzard</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pumpkin pie pieces</strong> — Spiced pumpkin filling with pastry, the defining flavor element</li>
      <li><strong>Cinnamon spice</strong> — Warm autumn spice blend that ties all elements together</li>
      <li><strong>Graham cracker crumble</strong> — Adds the pie crust texture and a buttery sweetness</li>
      <li><strong>DQ vanilla soft serve</strong> — The cool, creamy base that balances the warm spice profile</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>When Is the Pumpkin Pie Blizzard Available?</h2>
    <p>The Pumpkin Pie Blizzard is a fall seasonal item, typically available from late August or September through November at participating DQ locations. It is one of DQ's fastest-selling seasonal Blizzards — once it sells out at your local DQ, it is gone until next year. Check the <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard Treats page</a> for the current seasonal lineup.</p>
    <h2>Pumpkin Pie Blizzard vs. Other Autumn Flavors</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pumpkin Pie Blizzard</strong> — Spiced, warm-flavor profile, graham cracker crunch, 490 cal (Small). The signature fall DQ Blizzard.</li>
      <li><strong>Pecan Pie Blizzard</strong> — Pecan pieces and caramel, similar warm-autumn profile. Available at select locations.</li>
      <li><strong>S'mores Blizzard</strong> — Available in summer, sometimes extends into fall. Different profile — chocolate-forward rather than spiced.</li>
    </ul>
