    <h2>Pumpkin Pie Blizzard — DQ's Fall Classic</h2>
    <p>The Pumpkin Pie Blizzard is Dairy Queen's signature fall seasonal Blizzard — typically available from late September through November. It blends pumpkin pie pieces and pie crust bits with DQ soft serve for a dessert that captures the flavors of Thanksgiving in frozen form. At $3.99 Mini and 510 cal (Small), it is priced in the mid-range seasonal tier. See all current Blizzard flavors on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

    <h2>Pumpkin Pie Blizzard — What's Inside</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pumpkin pie-flavored pieces</strong> — Spiced pumpkin filling frozen into blendable pieces</li>
      <li><strong>Pie crust bits</strong> — Buttery, crumbly pastry crust pieces add texture</li>
      <li><strong>DQ vanilla soft serve</strong> — Cream base that balances the spiced pumpkin</li>
      <li><strong>Pumpkin pie spice</strong> — Cinnamon, ginger, nutmeg, and clove notes throughout</li>
